00:16:07,717 --> 00:16:09,067
宝贝儿
Honey.

350
00:16:09,097 --> 00:16:10,287
我要去兜风了
I'm going for a drive.

351
00:16:10,307 --> 00:16:12,087
我本来准备了一个秘密晚餐
I had a whole private dinner planned.

352
00:16:12,087 --> 00:16:13,227
结果不知道为什么变这样了
I don't know what happened.

353
00:16:13,257 --> 00:16:16,807
我知道 我明白怎么回事
But I do. I know exactly what happened!

354
00:16:16,837 --> 00:16:18,937
不 你不知道
No, you don't.

355
00:16:22,917 --> 00:16:26,077
-什么 -我赢了
- What the hell? - I win!

356
00:16:26,107 --> 00:16:29,237
我早发现你偷偷摸摸 打算耍我一下
I see you sneaking around, trying to trick me,

357
00:16:29,287 --> 00:16:31,267
所以当我搞清楚之后
so when I figure it out,

358
00:16:31,267 --> 00:16:35,007
就把晚餐移到这边来了 然后耍了你 我赢啦
I move the party over here, and I trick you. I win!

359
00:16:35,007 --> 00:16:36,107
什么叫你赢了
What do you mean, you win?

360
00:16:36,147 --> 00:16:38,517
我知道你觉得我认为你不够浪漫
I know you think I think you're not romantic,

361
00:16:38,557 --> 00:16:41,267
但我觉得你认为我没你聪明
but I think you think I'm not smarter than you.

362
00:16:41,307 --> 00:16:42,267
现在真相大白了
So now we know.

363
00:16:42,287 --> 00:16:45,427
你够浪漫 我也比你聪明
You are romantic, and I'm smarter than you.

364
00:16:45,457 --> 00:16:47,987
而且我还给你买了辆摩托
And I bought you a motorcycle.

365
00:16:48,007 --> 00:16:50,227
天哪 这车真棒
Oh, my God. It's fantastic.

366
00:16:50,247 --> 00:16:51,487
我又赢了
I win again!

367
00:16:51,507 --> 00:16:55,388
宝贝儿 我喜欢这一切 不过情人节不是让你赢的
Honey, I love all this, but you can't win Valentine's Day.

368
00:16:55,408 --> 00:16:56,948
我是说 如果你把情人节搞成一个
I mean, you defeat the whole idea

369
00:16:56,948 --> 00:16:59,598
愚蠢的竞赛 那这节日的意义就没了
if you make it into some silly competition.

370
00:16:59,638 --> 00:17:01,738
闭嘴吧 我赢了
Shut up. I win.

371
00:17:05,588 --> 00:17:07,298
-出发吧 -我们真要去吗
- Let's go. - So we're really doing this?

372
00:17:07,318 --> 00:17:09,378
-必须的 -他肯定是迷上我的
- Oh, we're doing this. - Well, it's gonna be me.

373
00:17:09,418 --> 00:17:11,358
-我已经在为你等会的囧样难过了 -好吧 走
- I'm already embarrassed for you. - All right.

374
00:17:11,378 --> 00:17:13,858
-等一下 -怎么了
- Oh, wait. - What?

375
00:17:13,888 --> 00:17:16,758
-布拉德利克来短信了 -读出来
- Oh, it's a text from Broderick. - Read it.

376
00:17:17,958 --> 00:17:19,688
"米奇尔 我相信你爱人已经告诉你
"Mitchell, by now I'm sure Cameron

377
00:17:19,688 --> 00:17:21,978
在电梯里发生的一切了
has told you what happened in the elevator.

378
00:17:22,008 --> 00:17:24,398
我所说的一切都是肺腑之言
While I meant every word I said,

379
00:17:24,398 --> 00:17:27,008
我明白这样做十分失职
I realize how unprofessional I was.

380
00:17:27,038 --> 00:17:29,038
请接受我的辞职
Please accept my resignation.

381
00:17:29,058 --> 00:17:31,018
你和你爱人的感情来之不易
What you have with Cam is very special,

382
00:17:31,058 --> 00:17:34,618
如果我成了第三者 我永远不会原谅自己
and I would never forgive myself if I came between you.

383
00:17:34,648 --> 00:17:38,028
从心底祝福你们 珍重对方 布拉德利克"
Treasure each other. Sincerely, Broderick".

384
00:17:38,668 --> 00:17:43,438
-天哪 我们在干什么呢 -我也不知道
- Oh, Cam, what are we doing here? - I don't know.

385
00:17:43,468 --> 00:17:44,848
如果一个小秘书对谁着迷
Maybe if some assistant's crush

386
00:17:44,848 --> 00:17:46,358
值得我们如此大动干戈的话
is so important to us,

387
00:17:46,388 --> 00:17:50,158
我们真应该更加珍惜对方
it means we should appreciate each other a little bit more.

388
00:17:50,598 --> 00:17:52,988
是啊 这正是个重新开始的好时机 来吧
Well, I can't think of a better time to start. Come here.

389
00:17:54,968 --> 00:17:56,688
而短信最棒的地方就在于
And the great thing about that text

390
00:17:56,688 --> 00:17:59,198
我们无需知道他到底迷上了谁
is we don't have to know which one of us he wanted.

391
00:17:59,228 --> 00:18:00,828
我知道
I know.

392
00:18:01,328 --> 00:18:02,798
我知道
I know.

393
00:18:08,498 --> 00:18:09,978
你在这干什么呢
What are you doing?

394
00:18:10,008 --> 00:18:13,579
情人节还没结束呢 朱莉安娜
Valentine's Day isn't over yet, Juliana.

395
00:18:13,609 --> 00:18:15,049
亲爱的 别强求了
Sweetie, let's not push it.

396
00:18:15,049 --> 00:18:16,179
你今晚可是差点进警局了
You almost got arrested tonight.

397
00:18:16,199 --> 00:18:17,889
那今晚就这么不了了之吗
That's how it's gonna be?

398
00:18:17,919 --> 00:18:20,639
-你就这么放弃我们的感情吗 -我不是放弃
- You're just giving up on us? - I am not giving up on us.

399
00:18:20,669 --> 00:18:24,059
我只是放弃了克莱夫和朱莉安娜
I am giving up on Clive and Juliana.

400
00:18:24,089 --> 00:18:26,269
等一下 等等 等等
Wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

401
00:18:26,299 --> 00:18:28,779
我知道有不少男女都有本事挽回这局面
I know a couple of people who could possibly save this night.

402
00:18:28,809 --> 00:18:30,629
或许你知道他俩
Maybe you've heard of them...

403
00:18:30,659 --> 00:18:33,749
两个美国青年尽他们所能
"Two American kids, doing the best that they can..."

404
00:18:34,499 --> 00:18:36,309
菲尔和克莱尔
Phil and Claire Dunphy.

405
00:18:36,339 --> 00:18:38,089
我今晚绝对不会再回那个旅馆了
I am not going back to that hotel tonight,

406
00:18:38,089 --> 00:18:39,829
而且我肯定你被禁止进入了
and I'm pretty sure you're not allowed to.

407
00:18:39,859 --> 00:18:41,879
不需要 菲尔和克莱尔有间卧室
Don't need to. Phil and Claire have a bedroom,

408
00:18:41,909 --> 00:18:44,799
他们随时可以把那间卧室当成旅馆
which they can turn into a hotel whenever they want.

409
00:18:45,299 --> 00:18:46,729
但是孩子们
But the kids...

410
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:49,359
他们不会料到我们这么早回家
They're not expecting us home this early.

411
00:18:49,409 --> 00:18:54,849
如何 你准备好去冒险了吗
So, you up for a little adventure...

412
00:18:54,879 --> 00:18:56,649
克莱尔
Claire?

413
00:18:56,689 --> 00:18:59,249
你觉得你能搞定吗
Do you think you can handle it...

414
00:18:59,849 --> 00:19:01,699
菲尔
Phil?

415
00:19:05,809 --> 00:19:07,999
"戴维 我无法成为你理想中的女孩
"I can't be the girl you want me to be, David.

416
00:19:08,029 --> 00:19:11,929
我只能做我自己 再见了 海莉"
"I can only be me. Goodbye. Haley."

417
00:19:11,959 --> 00:19:13,569
发送
Send it.

418
00:19:13,609 --> 00:19:16,449
-我犹豫不决 -来吧 我帮你发送
- I don't know. - Here, I'll help you.

419
00:19:16,469 --> 00:19:18,849
别 别 别
No, no, no, no, no!

420
00:19:20,659 --> 00:19:21,929
哇
Wow.

421
00:19:22,639 --> 00:19:24,509
感觉真棒
That feels really good.

422
00:19:24,549 --> 00:19:26,209
因为你自由了
Because you're free.

423
00:19:26,239 --> 00:19:29,729
可我很害怕 我从九岁开始就从未单身过
And really scary. I haven't been single since I was 9.

424
00:19:29,759 --> 00:19:31,710
所以你应该开始慢慢来
That's why you need to take your time now...

425
00:19:31,740 --> 00:19:34,590
在你做任何决定之前必须先了解自己
Really get to know yourself before you make any decisions...

426
00:19:34,610 --> 00:19:36,530
大概花五六年吧
Five, six years maybe.

427
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:38,580
要数以年计吗 我得给戴维打电话
Years?! I have to call David.

428
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:40,770
打电话给一个情人节把你置之不理的人吗
The boy who tossed you aside on Valentine's Day?

429
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:42,440
不需要
No.

430
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:43,570
你配得上更好的人 海莉
You deserve better, Haley,

431
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:46,160
一个梦想家 一个诗人
a dreamer, a poet.

432
00:19:46,190 --> 00:19:47,550
等着他出现吧
Wait for him.

433
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,490
他说不定就近在眼前
He may be closer than you think.

434
00:19:51,970 --> 00:19:53,490
你听见音乐声了吗
Do you hear music?

435
00:19:53,530 --> 00:19:55,990
当然 你之所以也能听见是因为
Yes, and the fact that you hear it, too...

436
00:19:56,020 --> 00:19:58,200
是迪兰吗
Is that Dylan?!

437
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:00,130
天哪
Oh my God!

438
00:20:07,010 --> 00:20:09,710
*想象我赤身裸体*
*Imagine me naked.*

439
00:20:13,830 --> 00:20:16,370
我真是个坏到连这个都能无视的家长吗
Am I a bad enough parent to ignore that?

440
00:20:16,410 --> 00:20:20,090
没错 你可坏了
You are. You're really bad.

441
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:26,240
*为你舍弃朋友也愿意*
*Without my best friend.*

442
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:28,900
你看 如果你是之前那个海莉 早就
You know, the old Haley would have...

443
00:20:28,940 --> 00:20:31,490
-我爱你宝贝 -海莉
- I love you, baby! - Haley!

444
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:37,020
干杯 杰
Salud, Jay!

445
00:20:42,090 --> 00:20:43,940
-我的背挂彩了 -菲尔
- There's my back. - Phil.

446
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:48,140
-不用找零了 -谢谢
- Oh, no, keep the change. - Oh, thanks.

447
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:50,551
你是不是又在里面多放了一块提拉米酥啊
Did you put an extra tiramisu in here?

448
00:20:50,591 --> 00:20:52,711
-算是吧 -雷恩 老照顾我们不太好吧
- Maybe. - Ryan, again?

449
00:20:52,751 --> 00:20:54,271
我只是很喜欢来你们这嘛
I just like coming here.

450
00:20:54,301 --> 00:20:56,051
我跟你说 如果你是单身的话
I tell you, if you were single...

451
00:21:10,511 --> 00:21:12,801
-雷恩 -雷恩
- Ryan! - Ryan!
